dukkanaaʼa;","poem":1},{"text":"ibsaan isa bira jirus ni dhaama.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"Jabinni tarkaanfii isaa ni dadhaba;","poem":1},{"text":"malli isaas isuma kuffisa.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"Miilli isaa kiyyoo keessa isa buusa;","poem":1},{"text":"inni boolla kiyyeeffame irra ni joora.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"Kiyyoon kottee isaa qaba;","poem":1},{"text":"futtaasaanis jabeessee isa qaba.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"Lafa irra funyoon isaaf dhokfameera;","poem":1},{"text":"karaa isaa irras kiyyoon kaaʼameera.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"Naasuun karaa hundaan isa sodaachisa;","poem":1},{"text":"faana isaa buʼees isa ariʼa.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"Badiisni afaan itti banateera;","poem":1},{"text":"balaanis qophaaʼee jiguu isaa eeggata.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"Gogaan isaa dhukkubaan nyaatamee dhuma;","poem":1},{"text":"ilmi duʼaa hangaftichi harkaa fi miilla isaa nyaata.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"Inni dunkaana abdate keessaa buqqifamee","poem":1},{"text":"gara mootii sodaatti geeffama.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"Waan kan isaa hin taʼinis dunkaana isaa keessa jiraata;","poem":1},{"text":"dinyiin bobaʼus iddoo inni jiraatu irra faffacaʼa.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"Jalaan hiddi isaa ni goga;","poem":1},{"text":"irraan immoo dameen isaa ni coollaga.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"Yaadannoon isaa lafa irraa ni bada;","poem":1},{"text":"maqaan isaas lafa irraa ni dhabama.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"Inni ifa keessaa gara dukkanaatti darbatama;","poem":1},{"text":"addunyaa irraas ni dhabama.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"Inni saba isaa gidduutti ijoollee yookaan sanyii,","poem":1},{"text":"biyya duraan jiraate keessatti hambaa hin qabaatu.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"Namoonni dhiʼaa waaʼee isaa dhagaʼanii rifatu;","poem":1},{"text":"warri baʼaas sodaadhaan guutamu.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"Iddoon jireenya nama hamaa, dhugumaan akkana taʼa;","poem":1},{"text":"iddoon nama Waaqa hin beeknees kanuma taʼa.”","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/gaz_bib/JOB/18.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_bib/JOB/19.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_bib/JOB/17.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}